Your pet should never go wild so long as you are on the same dungeon 
level as the pet is. Also, in my experience, digging out vaults using 
Raisse's method is fairly easy; it's usually the blank spot in the map. 
Granted, some maps have large blank spots, especially maps with just a 
couple rooms. However, these are easily foiled using a !oOD, ?oMM, ?oGD, 
or similar means.

You could also dig the vault out with wands of digging if you are 
concerned about food usage. They are certainly common enough.

